OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely dry  
OL,6,Fwith variable cloud and clear spells   
OL,7,Fthis evening. Becoming increasingly    
OL,8,Fcloudy with outbreaks of rain, heavy   
OL,9,Fat times, reaching Cornwall this       
OL,10,Fevening, before spreading steadily     
OL,11,Fnortheast to affect much of Cornwall   
OL,12,Fand Devon overnight. Freshening        
OL,13,Fsoutheasterly winds.                   
OL,15,CSunday:FA very wet day for many as     
OL,16,Fpersistent rain continues, mainly      
OL,17,Ffocused around Devon. Feeling cold,    
OL,18,Fespecially with the brisk breeze       
OL,19,Finland and the very strong coastal     
OL,20,Fwinds.                                 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
