OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fin the southwest on Monday with        
OL,7,Fshowery spells later. On Tuesday,      
OL,8,Fwindy with spells of rain. Calmer on   
OL,9,FWednesday but with further intervals   
OL,10,Fof rain and cloud.                     
